{{PageBanner|Crashfever banner en 2020.png|event}}
A collaboration event between [[Nyanko Daisensou]] and the RPG puzzle game known as '''Crash Fever''' (クラッシュフィーバー, ''Kurasshu Fībā'', '''Crash Fever''') was originally held from March 21st, 2017 to April 4th, 2017. The collaboration includes an exclusive Gacha, stages, [[Catnip Challenges]] and stamps going on during collaboration period.<br>
The game is published by [https://wonderpla.net/en/ Wonder Planet Inc].

==Event Information==
{{Color|#FF0000|'''Crash Fever'''}} & {{Color|#FF0000|'''The Battle Cats'''}} meet up once again for the return of a thrilling collab event!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''On between November 4th and 18th, 2020!'''}}

{{Color|#FF0000|'''●Crash Fever Collab Capsules!'''}}<br>
Only for a short time, Crash Fever collab capsules are available in The Battle Cats!

[[Mobius (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF00FF|'''MOBIUS (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Massive damage to Red enemies, with 100% knockback!<br>
[[Belial (Super Rare Cat)|{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''BELIAL (Super Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Gets much stronger as he takes damage!<br>
<small><small>※ Both the Crash Fever limited edition units and normal Rare Capsule units may be received from draws at the
Collab Capsules, but Crash Fever units cannot be received from any other Rare Capsule set. Tap the Capsule Set
select icons at the top of the Rare Capsule screen to select Crash Fever if you want to get a limited edition unit!<br>
※ If Crash Fever capsule set content does not appear, make sure that you have a strong network connection are
updated to the most recent version of The Battle Cats.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''●Returning Crash Fever Collab Stages'''}}<br>
Visit the Stories of Legend / Event Stages to select the limited edition collab map {{Color|#335599|'''Gates of ALICE!'''}}<br>
Then, three days after the collab starts ({{Color|#FF00FF|'''November 7th (11:00-)'''}}), the next special map, {{Color|#335599|'''Moonlit City'''}}, will also appear!<br>
Next, find out if you're tough enough to conquer the ultimate Crash Fever challenge in the {{Color|#1ECCFF|'''Queen Rampant'''}} map! These stages will be available throughout the campaign.<br>
Pick up tons of XP as a reward on Stage Clear!<br>
Clear any stage on either of these maps to receive Timed Score rewards, and {{Color|#FF00FF|'''30 Cat Food'''}} when you clear all stages on a map.<br>
These stages are only available for a short time, so don't miss out on your chance to take on these special challenges!<br>
<small><small>※ If Crash Fever special event stages do not appear, make sure that you have a strong network connection are updated to the most recent version of The Battle Cats.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''●Special Missions in the Catnip Challenges!'''}}<br>
Collect limited-time mission rewards by completing Crash Fever stages!<br>
Once you've met the requirements, head to the Catnip Challenges and accept your prizes!<br>
<small><small>※These Special missions can only be completed until November 18th at 11:00am, so don't forget to claim your rewards before then!</small></small>

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''●Login daily to earn a new login stamp!'''}}<br>
Every day you visit the Cat Base menu during this campaign, you will pick up another login stamp that unlocks a new useful item with each one you collect, even a Rare Ticketreward! Log in every day and get all the goodies!

Visit the official site below for more info about Crash Fever!<br>
https://www.facebook.com/CrashFeverEN/<br>
© WonderPlanet Inc.

